	<data name="ui.welcome2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Here is the Beboo Garden.
It's a large square of greenery, featuring a small lagoon to the left and tall fruit trees to the right.
To navigate the garden, I highly recommend wearing headphones or earphones.
It is currently empty, except for an egg about to hatch, which you should hear on your right.
Once this dialogue is closed, move using the arrow keys towards the egg, and when you hear it in front of you, press the space bar to help your Beboo break its shell.</value>
